        "message": "fix(agentd): preserve original completed history shapes and refusal identity\n\nUse the canonical bounded completed-learning refusal owner in the two original observers. Keep missing-file failures, exact bindings, terminal acknowledgement and postchecks.\n\nAccept the actual complete checkpoint shape after the original scoped Coordinator replay, retaining the TrainingNoUpdate exclusion and real NextUse requirement. Keep all seven physical journal pairs while deriving the LocalDecision record count and bounded six/seven signature representation from the validated terminal. Original signature verification, current authority and immutable first-fact checks remain.\n\nBind eleven source paths only. Actual format, compile and original justfix pass without a lint source delta. The exact source passes 467 controls in 53 modules, 908 protected records, 432 related boundaries and the full 1164-boundary caller CLI. Native components and the original complete NoUpdate parent are separate subsequent qualification; this commit does not claim they pass.",
